# t3 — natural grain fixture (mirrors demos/13-typed-registries/135-natural-grain.bqn)
# fuel is nat: writes floor to the integer grid and the ceiling is 2^53, the last
# contiguous integer of the double. Row 0 holds 2^52 so one multiply crosses it.
n 3
col alive bool 1 1 1
col fuel nat 4503599627370496 10 7
